GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove the photo of a recipe
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archive a recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6bc19792-0788-44ae-a566-fd54b16ceb23/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

