GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/cost?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stage timeline and ready window for a start time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/timeline?start=2026-11-26T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start window for a desired ready time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/start-window?readyAt=2026-11-27T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

