GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2/production-figures?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Production calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches?status=planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a batch and build its plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "9d2f63d3-eac7-4a52-a3a6-bae64c20507f",
      "remindToFeedStarter": true
    }
  ]
}

### Plan a batch without saving it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "e6e62d43-bafb-462e-8b2d-88853bb427c2",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "9d2f63d3-eac7-4a52-a3a6-bae64c20507f",
      "remindToFeedStarter": true
    }
  ]
}

