### Baking history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statistics per recipe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a history record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/11656437-e094-4620-a1b1-ce7df5c8c422
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set rating and comment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bake-records/11656437-e094-4620-a1b1-ce7df5c8c422
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

